# Build context is the repo root (services/api/Dockerfile). Allow-list only what the API image needs;
# everything else (.env files, credentials, node_modules, apps/) never enters the context.
*
!services/api/pyproject.toml
!services/api/uv.lock
!services/api/app
!ai
!data
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
data/raw
